9
00:00:08,179 --> 00:00:09,017
el suyo.

10
00:00:09,017 --> 00:00:09,965
Cruzas la ciudad

11
00:00:09,965 --> 00:00:10,801
porque allá el

12
00:00:10,801 --> 00:00:11,692
mercado sale un

13
00:00:11,692 --> 00:00:12,907
